Description: iCarpay — 本机 CarPlay 车机端
 Turn a jailbroken iPhone into a wireless CarPlay head unit.
 The iPhone pairs over Bluetooth, joins the receiver's hotspot, then the
 encrypted CarPlay video stream is decoded on-device and touches are sent back.
 .
 Derived from Showcase (GPL-3.0-or-later) by Amine Rostane.
 rootful build (iphoneos-arm) for unc0ver / checkra1n style jailbreaks:
 real /Applications, /usr/bin, /Library/LaunchDaemons, no jbroot prefix.
